==English==

===Etymology===
[[seed]] + [[-ling]]

===Adjective===
'''seedling'''

# which is a seedling (see below)

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{botany}} A young [[plant]] grown from [[seed]]
# Any young, especially
## one grown in a [[nursery]] for transplanting
## a tree smaller then a [[sapling]].

